cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this benchmark, please cite it as below."
title: "Boltz-2 Water-Count Benchmark"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible benchmark of how explicitly requesting 1-10 water molecules (as independent
  CCD HOH entities) affects Boltz-2 protein-ligand structure prediction and whether predicted
  water oxygens reproduce crystallographic water positions.
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-10-10"
